domain AgencyIndependentReview:
  description "Review the owner-approved immutable requirement snapshot, without accepting or changing it."
problem P1:
  |
    Owner approved the offered REVIEW_THEN_DECIDE route and requested review.
premise A1:
  |
    This authorizes independent review, not requirement acceptance, implementation,
    new ADR, Seal mutation, push, paid provider use or revision of candidate text.
evidence E1:
  |
    Current requirement revision 1 SHA256 is
    f733f85a153349e4be28785fef05d93006d057e0e5d507a8423b658f9bb7f444,
    matching the owner-visible review input. Its six questions and scope are readable.
evidence E2:
  |
    Matching worktree remains on 0754ca7 with prior CA-00 and proposal WIP.
    requirement-authority-review mandates immutable step 3 review and classified
    findings, followed by owner disposition at step 4.
pending U1:
  |
    Independent review findings and source-contract consistency are not yet established.
premise OPTIONS:
  |
    A review exact snapshot with independent context and verify findings against sources.
    B accept or modify the requirement now, rejected because authority is only for review.
decision D1 based_on P1, A1, E1, E2, U1, OPTIONS:
  |
    Delegate a read-only independent review of the exact candidate and review input,
    without author conclusions. In parallel verify source authorities and snapshot
    identities locally. Record owner route and final classified report separately
    from the unchanged candidate. Do not promote optional scope to contradictions.
    Return completed or not-reviewable report for second owner review; no auto revision.
